# Skills are symlinks/junctions into the notes repo (memory/skills/), which is
# where their content is versioned. Git walks straight through a junction, so
# without this it would commit a second copy here and the two would drift.
# Recreating the links on a fresh clone: see memory/skills/README.md.
.agents/skills/

